y extension of the web interface at runtime by adding to the classpath and would also reduce iteration time when developing the web interface.\", \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 2, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('Aurora',155,'AURORA-722','42','{\"key\": \"AURORA-722\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 42, \"status\": \"Resolved\", \"creator\": \"Kevin Sweeney\", \"summary\": \"snapshot performance issues\", \"assignee\": \"Kevin Sweeney\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"Kevin Sweeney\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 1, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 3, \"description\": \"In one of our larger production clusters we\'re seeing issues with snapshot performance that cause the scheduler to failover before completing a snapshot.For background the scheduler writes a compressed (when -deflate_snapshots is enabled) binary-encoded Snapshot (from api.thrift) to the mesos replicated log every hour (or -dlog_snapshot_interval). This snapshot represents most of the scheduler\'s heap usage including the configuration for all tasks running in the cluster.Add appropriate instrumentation to the snapshot routine and patch any obvious performance bottlenecks.\", \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 5, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('Aurora',156,'AURORA-742','42','{\"key\": \"AURORA-742\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 42, \"status\": \"Resolved\", \"creator\": \"Mark Chu-Carroll\", \"summary\": \"Add client commands to query server-driven updates.\", \"assignee\": \"Mark Chu-Carroll\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"Mark Chu-Carroll\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Task\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 1, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 1, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('Aurora',157,'AURORA-780','42','{\"key\": \"AURORA-780\", \"votes\": 