 Sweeney\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 1, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 3, \"description\": \"This is required to allow the announcer to talk to zookeeper clusters requiring authentication\", \"fixVersions\": 0, \"commentCount\": 1, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('Aurora',242,'AURORA-925','53','{\"key\": \"AURORA-925\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 53, \"status\": \"Resolved\", \"creator\": \"Kevin Sweeney\", \"summary\": \"refactor build.gradle to extract thrift compilation as a separate task class\", \"assignee\": \"Kevin Sweeney\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"Kevin Sweeney\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Task\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 3, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 1, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('Aurora',243,'AURORA-930','53','{\"key\": \"AURORA-930\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 53, \"status\": \"Resolved\", \"creator\": \"Chris Lambert\", \"summary\": \"GC performance issues with snapshot deduplication on large clusters\", \"assignee\": \"Kevin Sweeney\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"Chris Lambert\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 2, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 3, \"description\": \"We observed very long GC pauses in our production cluster we believe are caused by the extra heap pressure caused by SnapshotDeduplicatorImpl\'s extra deep copy of a Snapshot object.Also EntrySerializer fully buffers the full binary-encoded thrift Snapshot before writing it to the replicated log - it can avoid memory pressure by streaming instead.\", \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 4, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('Aurora',244,'AURORA-939','53','{\"key\": \"AURORA-939\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 53, \"status\": \"R