ng Zhu\", \"summary\": \"Make remaining quota to offer event-driven in the allocator.\", \"assignee\": \"Meng Zhu\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"Meng Zhu\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 1, \"issueType\": \"Improvement\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 2, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1, \"description\": \"Currently in the allocator role consumed quota info is built up from scratch at the beginning of each allocation iteration. This affects performance and increases code complexity. We should be able to track and persist this info as we make new allocations.\", \"fixVersions\": 0, \"commentCount\": 1, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('Meso',29,'MESOS-8802','372','{\"key\": \"MESOS-8802\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 1, \"sprint\": 372, \"status\": \"Accepted\", \"creator\": \"Meng Zhu\", \"summary\": \"Make remaining quota to offer event-driven in the allocator.\", \"assignee\": \"Meng Zhu\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"Meng Zhu\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 1, \"issueType\": \"Improvement\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 2, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1, \"description\": \"Currently in the allocator role consumed quota info is built up from scratch at the beginning of each allocation iteration. This affects performance and increases code complexity. We should be able to track and persist this info as we make new allocations.\", \"fixVersions\": 0, \"commentCount\": 1, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('Meso',30,'MESOS-8802','379','{\"key\": \"MESOS-8802\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 1, \"sprint\": 379, \"status\": \"Accepted\", \"creator\": \"Meng Zhu\", \"summary\": \"Make remaining quota to offer event-driven in the allocator.\", \"assignee\": \"Meng Zhu\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"Meng Zhu\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 1, \"issueType\": \"Improvement\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 2, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1, \"description\": \"Currently in the allocator role 