r.java:918)at java.lang.Thread.run(Thread.java:680){code}I think it would be helpful to provide users with some helpful advice e.g.:Redis does not seem to be running at \'localhost/127.0.0.1:6379\'. Did you start or install Redis? Please see for further help http://foo/bar\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',105,'XD-135','8','{\"key\": \"XD-135\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 8, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"summary\": \"Documentation on XD Architecture\", \"assignee\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 4.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"Show overall flow of data in a stream the server components \'admin\' and \'container\'.  How modules are deployed.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',106,'XD-126','8','{\"key\": \"XD-126\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 8, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"summary\": \"Documentation for sources sinks modules should define which attributes are required and which optional\", \"assignee\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"This will eventually be supplied by the admin server but for now write it up by hand in the documentation\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',107,'XD-106','8','{\"key\": \"XD-106\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 8, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"summary\": \"Container server does not log a message that it has s