"Done\", \"creator\": \"David Turanski\", \"summary\": \"Disable Collection to Object conversion in DefaultTuple\", \"assignee\": \"David Turanski\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"David Turanski\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"DefaultFormattingConversionService provides Collection -> Object conversion which will produce the first item if the target type matches. Here this results in an unfortunate side effect getTuple(List<Tuple> list) would return a Tuple which is misleading. In this case it is preferable to treat it as an error if the argument is not a Tuple.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',270,'XD-367','15','{\"key\": \"XD-367\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 15, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"summary\": \"Final review of REST API structure document for streams taps and jobs\", \"assignee\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"Get closure on open discussion points for REST API wrt to streams taps and jobs.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',271,'XD-162','15','{\"key\": \"XD-162\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 15, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Fisher\", \"summary\": \"Create design document for implementation strategy to support message conversion in ChannelRegistry\", \"assignee\": \"David Turanski\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Fisher\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 7.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"The conversion should be based on content-type headers similar to the way Spring\'s HttpMessageConverters work (with mime types).Also the map of available converters should be extensible while including the most common defaults (for JSON XML etc). We most likely want to add a few of our own content types also (e.g. for Tuples).Most likely this logic and the configuration methods for extending the converter map belong in AbstractChannelRegistry since it should be common across all implementations (i.e. the logic should be the same regardless of the transport used after-serialization/before-deserialization).\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 2.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',272,'XD-375','15','{\"key\": \"XD-375\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 15, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"David Turanski\", \"summary\": \"Command to delete tap\", \"assignee\": \"Ilayaperumal Gopinathan\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"David Turanski\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',273,'XD-371','15','{\"key\": \"XD-371\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 15, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"David Turanski\", \"summary\": \"Command for creating a job\", \"assignee\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"David Turanski\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"optional --autostart switch to also deploy the job\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',274,'XD-372','15','{\"key\": \"XD-372\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 15, 