watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',646,'XD-343','31','{\"key\": \"XD-343\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"David Turanski\", \"summary\": \"Investigate JMX object naming of deployed modules and inbound/outbound channel adapters.\", \"assignee\": \"David Turanski\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"David Turanski\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 2.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 3.0, \"description\": \"The object naming is still not ideal for XD since SI conventions add some noise. Likely  need to design and implement a custom naming strategy\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 5.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',647,'XD-1127','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1127\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"summary\": \"Add support for deploying a batch job with partitioning across multiple XD nodes.\", \"assignee\": \"Gary Russell\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 20.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"This is a very big story needs some planning/discussion before starting work.  Should be able to be implemented as a plugin. \", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',648,'XD-1076','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1076\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"summary\": \"Create an FTP tasklet to get remote files and put them in the local file system.\", \"assignee\": \"Gary Russell\", \"priority\": 3.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 16.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"This is along the lines of what is in this blog posthttp://coreyreil.wordpress.com/2012/12/21/spring-batch-creating-an-ftp-tasklet-to-get-remote-files/Note that there have been some new developments in SI to get at the underlying stream for FTP.The way to test this is to create a new batch job in XD that has this as it\'s tasklet.  Going forward the target file system will also be HDFS.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',649,'XD-1244','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1244\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"summary\": \"Create CI Plan for XD EC2 deployment\", \"assignee\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"* Use the cleanup app from XD-1243 to stop previous CI runs of XD on EC2.* Build XD-EC2 deployer from github.* Use XD-EC2 Deployer to deploy the CI XD-Instance* Should produce artifact that contains the URL    * admin server of the XD cluster.   * container servers of the XD cluster\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',650,'XD-1237','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1237\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"summary\": \"Add option to stop all running XD EC2 instances that match a given naming pattern\", \"assignee\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 1.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 4.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"This functionality should be added as a command line option to the main app in the spring-xd-ec2 project\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 1.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',651,'XD-1139','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1139\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Gary Russell\", \"summary\": \"Add TaskLet to Stream from (S)FTP to HDFS\", \"assignee\": \"Gary Russell\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Gary Russell\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',652,'XD-1140','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1140\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Gary Russell\", \"summary\": \"Add (S)FTP Gateway and Batch Partitioner to List/Process Remote Files\", \"assignee\": \"Gary Russell\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Gary Russell\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 16.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',653,'XD-1242','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1242\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"summary\": \"Optimize deployment of xd-admin and multiple nodes in spring-xd-ec2 to occur in parallel.\", \"assignee\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 6.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"The deployment of nodes is sequential we can reduce the time to deploy a cluster greatly by having these tasks execute in parallel.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',654,'XD-1220','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1220\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"summary\": \"Batch jobs should use application.yml provided connection as default\", \"assignee\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"priority\": 3.0, \"reporter\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"Batch jobs should use application.yml provided connection as default. They now have their own configuration in batch-jdbc.properties. This config needs to account for any changes made to application.yml settings so the data is written to the batch metadata database by default.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 1.0}'),('Spring_XD',655,'XD-1213','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1213\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"summary\": \"Allow conditional validation for module options\", \"assignee\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 4.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"Using JSR303 groups which should be derived from injected values\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',656,'XD-1247','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1247\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"David Turanski\", \"summary\": \"Remove RedisStreamDeploymentIntegrationTests and RabbitStreamDeploymentIntegrationTests\", \"assignee\": \"David Turanski\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"David Turanski\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Improvement\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"These are duplicates of *SingleNodeDeploymentIntegrationTests\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',657,'XD-1248','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1248\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"David Turanski\", \"summary\": \"Merge AbstractStreamDeploymentIntegrationTests and AbstractSingleNodeStreamDeploymentIntegrationTests\", \"assignee\": \"David Turanski\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"David Turanski\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Improvement\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"We do not need two base classes for this\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',658,'XD-1249','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1249\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"David Turanski\", \"summary\": \"AbstractShellIntegrationTests should start and stop server once.\", \"assignee\": \"David Turanski\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"David Turanski\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Improvement\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"e.g. make application static and check for initialization. Need to ensure each test restores the initial state of the server\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',659,'XD-1250','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1250\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"David Turanski\", \"summary\": \"Investigate RabbitSingleNodeStreamDeploymentIntegrationTests performance\", \"assignee\": \"Gary Russell\", \"priority\": 3.0, \"reporter\": \"David Turanski\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Improvement\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"This test is very slow (2x the Redis version). Lots of stacktraces when running. Could be related. \", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',660,'XD-1114','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1114\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"David Turanski\", \"summary\": \"Investigate dropped Module Deployment Requests\", \"assignee\": null, \"priority\": 3.0, \"reporter\": \"David Turanski\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"We have observed in unit tests (see AbstractSingleNodeStreamIntegrationTests) that(Redis/SingleNode) occasionally fail. The root cause must be investigated further but there is some evidence to suggest that the control messages (ModuleDeploymentRequests) are not always received and handled by the ModuleDeployer. This does not produce an error but results in runtime stream failures. This problem may be resolved as part of the planned Deployment SPI but is being tracked here until we are certain that it has been resolved.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',661,'XD-1243','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1243\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"summary\": \"Create App for CI to Shutdown XD EC2 Cluster\", \"assignee\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 2.0, \"issueLinks\": 2.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"Application will shutdown all servers with a specific name.  Application will take a --cluster-name parameter.   Generate artifact to state success or failure  \", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 2.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',662,'XD-1146','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1146\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Gary Russell\", \"summary\": \"With Partitioned Jobs Wire Partitioner and StepExecutionHandlers with the MessageBus\", \"assignee\": \"Gary Russell\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Gary Russell\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 16.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',663,'XD-1254','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1254\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"David Turanski\", \"summary\": \"Optimize AbstractSingleNodeStreamDeploymentIntegrationTests\", \"assignee\": \"David Turanski\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"David Turanski\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Improvement\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"XD singlenode currenly initialized in @Before should be @BeforeClass. In this case must be re-initialized for each transport but not for each @Test.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',664,'XD-1212','31','{\"key\": \"XD-1212\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 31, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Luke Taylor\", \"summary\": \"Boot updates post 0.5 M7\", \"assignee\": \"Luke Taylor\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Luke Taylor\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0,