ary\": \"Remove spring-xd-analytics-ml-pmml project and module xml - to be put in seperate repository\", \"assignee\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"priority\": 3.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"AGPL license issues\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',794,'XD-1441','43','{\"key\": \"XD-1441\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 43, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"summary\": \"Implement XD_MODULE_CONFIG_LOCATION & NAME\", \"assignee\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"priority\": 3.0, \"reporter\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"The description in the google doc https://docs.google.com/a/gopivotal.com/document/d/12Cboa7nyVVKVxDIsHLJ-68m5f78ayXn14EJLrclJYVg/edit?usp=sharingdescribes the usage of XD_MODULE_CONFIG_LOCATION and XD_MODULE_CONFIG_NAME\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',795,'XD-1421','43','{\"key\": \"XD-1421\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 43, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"summary\": \"Create documentation for the core analytical model abstractions and use of jpmml processor\", \"assignee\": \"Thomas Darimont\", \"priority\": 3.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',796,'XD-1447','43','{\"key\": \"XD-1447\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 43, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"summary\": \"Add documentation for a \'stdin\' source module\", \"assignee\": \"Luke Taylor\", \"priority\": 3.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"In order to support ingestion from stdin the suggested approach is to do the following.xd:>stream create --definition \\\"tcp --decoder=LF | log\\\" --name foo$ cat my.log | netcat localhost 1234So while this is really a tcp based ingestion case once can use pipe or redirect of stdin/err in order to achieve the same goal.  It should appear as a source module in the docs on par with other source modules in its own section.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',797,'XD-1431','43','{\"key\": \"XD-1431\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 43, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Ilayaperumal Gopinathan\", \"summary\": \"Support multiple admin servers on a same host\", \"assignee\": \"Ilayaperumal Gopinathan\", \"priority\": 3.0, \"reporter\": \"Ilayaperumal Gopinathan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"By default XD admin server uses hsqldb as data source for batch job repository and uses the default port 9101 specific database location and dbname. This makes the existence of multiple admin server on a same host not possible. \", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',798,'XD-1422','43','{\"key\": \"XD-1422\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 43, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"summary\": \"Create a simple sample application for the jpmml module\", \"assignee\": \"Thomas Darimont\", \"priority\": 3.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 4.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"The sample application should primarily show the \'round trip\' that is possible in that \\\"offline\\\" analysis in R can generate a pmml flle that can be imported and evaluated in an \\\"online\\\" stream definition.  The specific use case can be as simple as the IRIS data set or other existing examples such as the fraud demo.The sample application resides in https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-xd-samples\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',799,'XD-1378','43','{\"key\": \"XD-1378\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 43, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"summary\": \"Change module placeholder names and remove context:property-placeholder usage\", \"assignee\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"e.g. rabbit.xml source.<context:property-placeholderlocation=\\\"${xd.config.home}/${configProperties:rabbit}.properties\\\"ignore-resource-not-found=\\\"true\\\" />would be removed and<rabbit:connection-factory id=\\\"rabbitConnectionFactory\\\" host=\\\"${host:${spring.rabbitmq.host:localhost}}\\\"port=\\\"${port:${spring.rabbitmq.port:5672}}\\\" virtual-host=\\\"${vhost:${spring.rabbitmq.virtualHost:/}}\\\"username=\\\"${username:${spring.rabbitmq.username:guest}}\\\" password=\\\"${password:${spring.rabbitmq.password:guest}}\\\"/>would look likeport=\\\"${port}\\\" and a property file in the module directory or POJO in the module lib would specify the default value of the port.For POJO it would beoptions_class = org.springframework.xd.dirt.modules.metadata.RabbitSourceOptionsMetadataFor property file it would beoption.port.default=5672option.port.description=\\\"cool port number\\\"This needs to be consistently done across all the modules.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 2.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',800,'XD-1052','43','{\"key\": \"XD-1052\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 43, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Fisher\", \"summary\": \"Enforce consistent naming across CLI options and command/template/operations method names\", \"assignee\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Fisher\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 4.0, \"watchcount\": 3.0, \"description\": \"e.g. see comment on PR #390:https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-xd/pull/390/files#r7563787In that case it\'s \\\"delete\\\" in one place and \\\"destroy\\\" in another. There are other cases as well.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 4.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',801,'XD-1208','43','{\"key\": \"XD-1208\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 43, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"summary\": \"Create Module options metadata for OOTB jobs\", \"assignee\": \"Ilayaperumal Gopinathan\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Luke Taylor\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 3.0, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 3.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',802,'XD-1424','43','{\"key\": \"XD-1424\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 43, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Derek Beauregard\", \"summary\": \"Docs could use link to Tuple artifacts\", \"assignee\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Derek Beauregard\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Improvement\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 0.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"The Tuple documentation http://docs.spring.io/spring-xd/docs/1.0.0.M5/reference/html/#tuples has no link or reference to the Jar(s) and/or Maven artifacts required to use Tuples in a project.  Took me a bit of searching to find the Maven artifacts.  Would be nice to include the jar name and maven/gradle config.  In Gradle (from the spring repo maven { url \\\"http://repo.spring.io/libs-snapshot\\\" }):compile \'org.springframework.xd:spring-xd-tuple:1.0.0.M5\'\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 1.0}'),('Spring_XD',803,'XD-1438','43','{\"key\": \"XD-1438\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 43, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Derek Beauregard\", \"summary\": \"RabbitMQ port wrong in Docs\", \"assignee\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"priority\": 5.0, \"reporter\": \"Derek Beauregard\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Improvement\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 0.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"The documentation (http://docs.spring.io/spring-xd/docs/1.0.0.M5/reference/html/#_using_rabbitmq) list the default RabbitMQ port as 5674.  It is 5672 and is correct in the SXD config.  \", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 1.0}'),('Spring_XD',804,'XD-1483','43','{\"key\": \"XD-1483\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 43, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Fisher\", \"summary\": \"StreamListener should watch /xd/deployments/streams\", \"assignee\": \"Patrick Peralta\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Fisher\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 4.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1.0, 