"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"As a user I\'d like to have a _Python_ processor so that I can efficiently perform data computations and statistical analysis. Investigate the right approach (native or via stdin/stdout) that fits Spring XD model.[Integrate Java and Python|https://wiki.python.org/moin/IntegratingPythonWithOtherLanguages#Java]\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 2.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1225,'XD-1791','66','{\"key\": \"XD-1791\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 66, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"summary\": \"New job that executes a Spark job\", \"assignee\": \"Ilayaperumal Gopinathan\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"Create OOTB batch job that executes a job on Spark as a taskletcould be something along this:job create yarnJob --definition \\\"sparkjob --master=spark://localhost:7077 --class=SimpleApp\\\"\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 2.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1226,'XD-2258','66','{\"key\": \"XD-2258\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 66, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Research adding support for \'spring-cloud-config\' to configure Modules\", \"assignee\": \"Marius Bogoevici\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"Please refer to the GH Issue reported here: https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-xd/issues/1218\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1227,'XD-2239','66','{\"key\": \"XD-2239\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 66, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Fix incorrect IP Address associated with containers\", \"assignee\": \"Gunnar Hillert\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 1.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"The XD Container IP address displayed on both \'singlenode\' and Distributed modes are incorrect both on _Shell_ as well as _Admin-UI_. *Example:*Noticed IP address as 10.10.10.*Following function in [RuntimeUtils|http://docs.spring.io/autorepo/docs/spring-xd/1.0.1.RELEASE/api/org/springframework/xd/dirt/util/RuntimeUtils.html] could be flawed:{code}public static String getIpAddress() {try {for(Enumeration<NetworkInterface> enumNic = NetworkInterface.getNetworkInterfaces();enumNic.hasMoreElements();) {NetworkInterface ifc = enumNic.nextElement();if (ifc.isUp()) {for (Enumeration<InetAddress> enumAddr = ifc.getInetAddresses();enumAddr.hasMoreElements(); ) {InetAddress address = enumAddr.nextElement();if (address instanceof Inet4Address && !address.isLoopbackAddress()) {return address.getHostAddress();}}}}}catch (IOException e) {// ignore}return \\\"unknown\\\";}{code}\", \"fixVersions\": 2.0, \"commentCount\": 2.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1228,'XD-2246','66','{\"key\": \"XD-2246\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 66, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Document default behavior if config option is not present\", \"assignee\": \"Gunnar Hillert\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Technical task\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a user I\'d like to have the flexibility to specify config options for IP and Hostname so that I can list the correct configuration for XD Admin and XD Container servers in the Admin-UI and Shell. \", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1229,'XD-2121','66','{\"key\": \"XD-2121\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 66, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Secure all endpoints using LDAP based security configurations\", \"assignee\": \"Marius Bogoevici\", \"priority\": 3.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 1.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a user I\'d like to have the option to provide LDAP based security configurations so that I can access the endpoints in a secured manner.Ideally all the listed *endpoints* (http://localhost:9393/) needs to be encapsulated within LDAP based security layer.Reference:[Authentication using LDAP|https://spring.io/guides/gs/authenticating-ldap/]\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1230,'XD-2182','66','{\"key\": \"XD-2182\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 66, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Marius Bogoevici\", \"summary\": \"Document how to enable LDAP security for admin endpoints\", \"assignee\": \"Marius Bogoevici\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Marius Bogoevici\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Technical task\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a user I want to know how to enable and configure LDAP as an authentication provider for the administration server so that I can set up my security configuration accordingly.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1231,'XD-2113','66','{\"key\": \"XD-2113\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 66, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"summary\": \"Redis aggregate-counter fails when end of interval is on the hour\", \"assignee\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"curl http://localhost:9393/metrics/aggregate-counters/smartgrid_h_28_load_predicted\\\\?resolution\\\\=minute\\\\&from\\\\=2013-09-01T12:55:00.000Z\\\\&to\\\\=2013-09-01T13:00:00.000Z would return 0 as the last bucket whilecurl http://localhost:9393/metrics/aggregate-counters/smartgrid_h_28_load_predicted\\\\?resolution\\\\=minute\\\\&from\\\\=2013-09-01T12:55:00.000Z\\\\&to\\\\=2013-09-01T13:05:00.000Zwould correctly return the value for 13:00:00\", \"fixVersions\": 2.0, \"commentCount\": 2.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1232,'XD-2098','66','{\"key\": \"XD-2098\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 66, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"summary\": \"Implement KafkaMessageBus\", \"assignee\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 1.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"Kafka lends itself well as a message bus and kafka partitioning maps to MB partitioning.Implement KafkaMessageBus and supporting classes and UT/IT.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 1.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1233,'XD-2237','66','{\"key\": \"XD-2237\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 66, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"David Turanski\", \"summary\": \"Provide Python module to handle I/O for implementing a Python shell processor \", \"assignee\": \"David Turanski\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"David Turanski\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1234,'XD-2026','66','{\"key\": \"XD-2026\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 66, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Ilayaperumal Gopinathan\", \"summary\": \"Handle random available http port for admin server\", \"assignee\": \"Janne Valkealahti\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Ilayaperumal Gopinathan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 4.0, \"description\": \"If the XD admin server lets tomcat chooses random http port by setting PORT or server.port to \'0\' the XD config logging and admin server context id still points to port zero as these are set before tomcat assigns the available random port.We also need to persist the admin servers\' ports into ZK so that this repo can be accessed by the client.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 6.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1235,'XD-2210','66','{\"key\": \"XD-2210\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 66, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Enhance JDBC sink test to include more options\", \"assignee\": null, \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"To enrich acceptance test I\'d like to add coverage to JDBC sink by including *-- driverclass* and *-- url* options.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1236,'XD-2274','66','{\"key\": \"XD-2274\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 66, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Patrick Peralta\", \"summary\": \"Intermittent TcpModulesTests.testTcpSink test failure\", \"assignee\": \"Patrick Peralta\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Patrick Peralta\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"{noformat}org.junit.ComparisonFailure: org.junit.ComparisonFailure: expected:<[Hi there!]> but was:<[]>org.junit.ComparisonFailure: expected:<[Hi there!]> but was:<[]>at org.junit.Assert.assertEquals(Assert.java:115)at org.junit.Assert.assertEquals(Assert.java:144)at org.springframework.xd.shell.command.TcpModulesTests.testTcpSink(TcpModulesTests.java:63)at sun.reflect.NativeMethodAccessorImpl.invoke0(Native Method)(60 more lines...){noformat}https://build.spring.io/browse/XD-JDK8-JOB1-1162/test\", \"fixVersions\": 2.0, \"commentCount\": 2.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1237,'XD-2225','66','{\"key\": \"XD-2225\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 66, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Gunnar Hillert\", \"summary\": \"REST: Make the Job Execution REST endpoint pagination-aware\", \"assignee\": \"Gunnar Hillert\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Gunnar Hillert\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 3.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"Implement pagination for:http://localhost:9393/jobs/executions\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1238,'XD-2281','66','{\"key\": \"XD-2281\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 66, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"summary\": \"Vary Producer and Consumer in combination using 2 Queues (B-6) \", \"assignee\": \"Chris Schaefer\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"The results from EC2 testing show that once prefetch and message size are set varying the number of producers or consumers independently does not impact the message rate.  The in-house testing numbers need another plan to try an understand some discrepancies. Using 500 prefetch 1000 byte message size run two instances of PerfTest at the same time with each instance referencing a different queue.  Vary the number of consumer and publishers.Test 1 (one producer / one consumer):* -a -u q1 -p -x 1 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500* -a -u q2 -p -x 1 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500Test 2 (one producer / two consumers):* -a -u q1 -p -x 1 -y 2 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500* -a -u q2 -p -x 1 -y 2 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500Test 3 (two producers / one consumer):* -a -u q1 -p -x 2 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 120 -q 500* -a -u q2 -p -x 2 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 120 -q 500Test 4 (two producers / two consumers):* -a -u q1 -p -x 2 -y 2 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500* -a -u q2 -p -x 2 -y 2 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1239,'XD-2282','66','{\"key\": \"XD-2282\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 66, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"summary\": \"Vary queue number (B-7)\", \"assignee\": \"Chris Schaefer\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"Based on the the results from B-6 select the number of consumer/producers that give a distinct >5% increase in message rate.  Below 5% change in message rate prefer lower consumer/producer count.    Vary the number of PerfTest instances that are run simultaneously and use their own independent queue from 1 until the overall messages/sec on the broker plateaus.   Note the CPU performance using ΓÇÿtopΓÇÖ for the broker and PerfTest processes.Test 1 (2 queues)* -a -u q1 -p -x 1 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500* -a -u q2 -p -x 1 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500Test 2 (3 queues)* -a -u q1 -p -x 1 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500* -a -u q2 -p -x 1 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500* -a -u q3 -p -x 1 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500Test 3 (4 queues)* -a -u q1 -p -x 1 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500* -a -u q2 -p -x 1 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500* -a -u q3 -p -x 1 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500* -a -u q4 -p -x 1 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500Test 4 (5 queues)* -a -u q1 -p -x 1 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500* -a -u q2 -p -x 1 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500* -a -u q3 -p -x 1 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500* -a -u q4 -p -x 1 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500* -a -u q5 -p -x 1 -y 1 -s 1000 -z 60 -q 500etc...\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1240,'XD-2301','67','{\"key\": \"XD-2301\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 67, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Research Spark integration options\", \"assignee\": \"Mark Fisher\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 1.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"*Spike scope:** Brainstorm* Identify options* Document\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1241,'XD-2305','67','{\"key\": \"XD-2305\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 67, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"POC for Spark Integration\", \"assignee\": \"Mark Fisher\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Technical task\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"de