 RabbitMQ\", \"assignee\": \"Gary Russell\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"https://jira.spring.io/browse/AMQP-453 Added support for compression with RabbitMQ.  XD should expose configuration options to enable and configure compression on the message bus.  Note some options may be specific for brokers or require additional functionality in XD.  This issue should not address adding additional functionality to make the feature set as common as possible across msg bus implementations but expose what makes sense with the current code base for rabbitmq   As an example Kafka supports compressed.topics which lets you pick a subset of topics to be compressed.  \", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1359,'XD-2472','70','{\"key\": \"XD-2472\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Kafka Bus: Add suppor for async vs. sync producer\", \"assignee\": \"Gary Russell\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Improvement\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 0.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a user I\'d like to have the option to choose between async vs. sync Kafka producer so that I can decide what algorithm better suits for sending messages. \", \"fixVersions\": 2.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1360,'XD-2485','70','{\"key\": \"XD-2485\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"summary\": \"Update spring-data-hadoop version to 2.0.4 for XD 1.0.3\", \"assignee\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1361,'XD-2483','70','{\"key\": \"XD-2483\", \"votes\": 2.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"summary\": \"Add codec option to hdfs-dataset sink\", \"assignee\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 1.0, \"issueLinks\": 2.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a user I would like to be able disable snappy compression when using hdfs-dataset sink with Avro files. I\'d also like to be able to provide a different codec.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 1.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1362,'XD-2484','70','{\"key\": \"XD-2484\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"summary\": \"Update spring-data-hadoop version to 2.1.0.M3\", \"assignee\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 1.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 1.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1363,'XD-2079','70','{\"key\": \"XD-2079\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Gary Russell\", \"summary\": \"Add a Retry/Dead Letter Interceptor to the RabbitMQ Source\", \"assignee\": \"Gary Russell\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Gary Russell\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\"