 by the Kafka [engineering team|https://engineering.linkedin.com/kafka/benchmarking-apache-kafka-2-million-writes-second-three-cheap-machines].\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1495,'XD-2806','78','{\"key\": \"XD-2806\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 78, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Mark Fisher\", \"summary\": \"Module count not respected when label is used\", \"assignee\": null, \"priority\": 2.0, \"reporter\": \"David Turanski\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"{code}xd:> stream create test --definition \\\"http | t1:transform --expression=payload | log\\\"xd:>stream deploy test --properties module.t1.count=2Deployed stream \'test\'xd:>runtime modules  Module Id            Container Id                          Options                                                                                                                                                                                            Deployment Properties                                                                       Unit status  -------------------  ------------------------------------  -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------  -----------  test.processor.t1.1  393d3af0-68e8-49b2-8601-da063cfbf98a  {valid=true expression=payload}                                                                                                                                                                   {consumer.sequence=1 producer.next.module.count=1 count=1 consumer.count=1 sequence=1}  deployed  test.sink.log.1      f6bb3189-9