 Spark streaming features like adding tap at the spark module output and the examples need to be updated.The documentation also needs some more information on `Reliable` receiver.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 2.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1716,'XD-3177','86','{\"key\": \"XD-3177\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 86, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Gary Russell\", \"summary\": \"Make RabbitMessageBus RabbitMQ Config Properties Optional\", \"assignee\": \"Gary Russell\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Gary Russell\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"When the bus is used outside of the XD container (e.g. spring-bus) the inheritance from Spring Boot configuration is broken (no application.yml or servers.yml on the cp).Make the bus properties optional (Add \\\":\\\")\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1717,'XD-2130','86','{\"key\": \"XD-2130\", \"votes\": 1.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 86, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Add Cassandra sink\", \"assignee\": \"Artem Bilan\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 1.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 4.0, \"description\": \"As a user I\'d like to have the option of _Cassandra_ sink so I can leverage the NoSQL database to write high volumes of variable data segments in high velocity.\", \"fixVersions\": 0.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 1.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1718,'XD-2979','86','{\"key\": \"XD-2979\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 86, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Submit java receptor client for CF incubation\", \"assignee\": \"Mark Fisher\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a user I\'d like to use the Java receptor client so I can interact with Diego runtime using the Java receptor REST APIs.\", \"fixVersions\": 0.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1719,'XD-3166','86','{\"key\": \"XD-3166\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 86, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Publish performance benchmarks\", \"assignee\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"As a developer I\'d like to publish performance benchmarks along with the infrastructure specifics so the users can use it as a reference while setting up Spring XD cluster.\", \"fixVersions\": 0.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1720,'XD-3164','86','{\"key\": \"XD-3164\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 86, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Marius Bogoevici\", \"summary\": \"Kafka bus defaults configurable at producer/consumer level\", \"assignee\": \"Marius Bogoevici\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Marius Bogoevici\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a developer I want to be able to override Kafka bus defaults for module consumers and producers so that I can finely tune performance and behaviour. Such properties should include- autoCommitEnabledqueueSizemaxWaitfetchSize for consumers- batchSizebatchTimeout for producers\", \"fixVersions\": 0.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1721,'XD-3169','86','{\"key\": \"XD-3169\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 86, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Spike: Explore options for batch modules to be short lived\", \"assignee\": \"Michael Minella\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 1.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"As a developer I\'d like a job module to be bootstrapped when the job is launched and shut down once it is complete instead of the current behavior of bootstrapping the context when the module is deployed regardless of if it\'s being used so that I can achieve better resource utilization.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 1.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1722,'XD-3161','86','{\"key\": \"XD-3161\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 86, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"summary\": \"Add CI Acceptance Test for 1.2.x\", \"assignee\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"Need acceptance tests to run on the 1.2.X branch.  Needs to be setup as a child of the Publish 1.2.x\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 1.0}'),('Spring_XD',1723,'XD-3172','86','{\"key\": \"XD-3172\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 86, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Gunnar Hillert\", \"summary\": \"Provide a source option to enable the SOF/EOF markers when splitting a file into lines\", \"assignee\": \"Gunnar Hillert\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Gunnar Hillert\