{\"key\": \"XD-3184\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 86, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"summary\": \"Update spring-xd-yarn servers.yml with settings for HDP 2.2.6.0\", \"assignee\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"We need to add the settings needed to run XD on YARN when using Hortonworks HDP 2.2.6.0 which is the version you now get when installing with Ambari.\", \"fixVersions\": 2.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1727,'XD-3189','86','{\"key\": \"XD-3189\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 86, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"summary\": \"Testers need ability to wait for a file to be created in XD directory\", \"assignee\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"User\'s need ability to wait for user specified time in millis for a file to be created in the XD directory.  If file is not created in allotted time then return false else return true.  Also check to see if a file exists in the XD directory.  \", \"fixVersions\": 2.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1728,'XD-3126','87','{\"key\": \"XD-3126\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 87, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"David Turanski\", \"summary\": \"Support for registering custom Kryo Serializers\", \"assignee\": \"David Turanski\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"David Turanski\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"This is an enhancement to KryoClassRegistrar or a related mechanism to initialize codecs using custom serializers to improve serialization performance. Currently XD will support POJOs that implement the kryo Serializable interface to gain a 2x performance improvement however initial benchmarks show that custom serializers are about 10% more performant than Serializable.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1729,'XD-3125','87','{\"key\": \"XD-3125\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 87, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"David Turanski\", \"summary\": \"Fail fast on Kryo registration conflicts\", \"assignee\": \"David Turanski\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"David Turanski\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"Currently kryo class registration is hard coded in spring-xd-codec. Users may register their own classes using an extension mechanism but it is possible to conflict with internal XD class registration e.g. Tuple. Exposing this using the same extension mechanism will make it more transparent. \", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1730,'XD-3162','87','{\"key\": \"XD-3162\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 87, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"summary\": \"Update Master Environment for 2.0 CI Acceptance Tests\", \"assignee\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 2.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1731,'XD-3169','87','{\"key\": \"XD-3169\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 87, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Spike: Explore options for batch modules to be short lived\", \"assignee\": \"Michael Minella\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 1.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"As a developer I\'d like a job module to be bootstrapped when the job is launched and shut down once it is complete instead of the current behavior of bootstrapping the context when the module is deployed regardless of if it\'s being used so that I can achieve better resource utilization.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 1.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1732,'XD-3192','87','{\"key\": \"XD-3192\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 87, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Spike: Investigate Boot export metrics and the XD fit\", \"assignee\": \"Gunnar Hillert\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 3.0, \"description\": \"As a user I\'d like to have the module/app specific metrics consumed directly from Boot actuator [export()|https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/blob/master/spring-boot-actuator/src/main/java/org/springframework/boot/actuate/autoconfigure/MetricRepositoryAutoConfiguration.java] API so I can have insight on how it is performing being used and that it works etc.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 2.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1733,'XD-3193','87','{\"key\": \"XD-3193\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 87, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Spike: Investigate bootification of module options\", \"assignee\": \"Eric Bottard\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a developer I\'d like to handle module options via pure boot property source management so I can leverage Boot\'s module [METADATA|http://docs.spring.io/spring-boot/docs/current-SNAPSHOT/reference/htmlsingle/#configuration-metadata] option to inject module options as opposed to maintaining them in core Spring XD runtime CP.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1734,'XD-3196','87','{\"key\": \"XD-3196\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 87, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Move MASTER branch CI builds to EC2 based infrastructure\", \"assignee\": \"Mark Pollack\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a developer I\'d like to migrate the current MASTER branch CI builds to EC2 instances so I can manage them all in one-place reliably.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1735,'XD-3202','87','{\"key\": \"XD-3202\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 87, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Investigate performance of channel metrics in SI 4.2 \", \"assignee\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 6.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 3.0, \"description\": \"As a developer I\'d like to investigate channel performance issues in SI 4.2 so I can determine the bottlenecks and take corrective actions to improve overall channel performance. \", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 4.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1736,'XD-3204','87','{\"key\": \"XD-3204\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 87, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Review spring-bus design specs\", \"assignee\": \"Mark Fisher\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a spring-bus lead I\'d like to review the current spring-bus architecture and the design specs so I can address any foundation level gaps.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1737,'XD-3205','87','{\"key\": \"XD-3205\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 87, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Investigate the steps to Ambari upgrade Spring XD\", \"assignee\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"As a user I\'d like to upgrade Spring XD from 1.2 RC to 1.2 GA using the Ambari plugin so I can work on the latest release bits. I\'d like to refer to the documentation to do so.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1738,'XD-3188','87','{\"key\": \"XD-3188\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 87, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Michael Minella\", \"summary\": \"FileDeletionListener resolves resources once\", \"assignee\": \"Michael Minella\", \"priority\": 3.0, \"reporter\": \"Michael Minella\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"In the {{filejdbc}} job there is the option to delete the imported files.  This functionality is created using a listener called the {{FileDeletionStepExecutionListener}}.  When you run the job the first time with the {{--deleteFiles=true}} everything works as expected.  The second time you run the job the files are not deleted.I believe the issue here is that since the {{FileDeletionStepExecutionListener}} is a singleton the resources are resolved only once (the first time the job runs) and so it works the first time but if the job is run again later and new files match the expression they are not picked up.  I believe the fix is to make the {{FileDeletionStepExecutionListener}} used in this job step scoped.\", \"fixVersions\": 2.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 1.0}'),('Spring_XD',1739,'XD-3217','87','{\"key\": \"XD-3217\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 87, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Cannot connect to admin server with basic security enabled\", \"assignee\": \"Marius Bogoevici\", \"priority\": 2.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 3.0, \"description\": \"As a user I\'m trying to connect to {{xd-admin}} server with basic security enabled; however I\'m unable to successfully connect to the server and I get the following error message.{code:java}server-unknown:>admin config server --uri http://localhost:9393 --username bob --password bobspwdUnable to contact XD Admin Server at \'http://localhost:9393\'.{code}\", \"fixVersions\": 2.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 1.0}'),('Spring_XD',1740,'XD-3214','87','{\"key\": \"XD-3214\", \"votes\": 1.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 87, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Karol Dowbecki\", \"summary\": \"Enabling security breaks Jobs page in Admin UI\", \"assignee\": \"Gunnar Hillert\", \"priority\": 1.0, \"reporter\": \"Karol Dowbecki\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 3.0, \"description\": \"After enabling Spring XD security in {{XD_HOME/config/servers.yml}}:{code}spring:  profiles: adminsecurity:  basic:    enabled: true    realm: SpringXDxd:  security:    authentication:      file:        enabled: true        users:          user: password ROLE_VIEW          admin: password ROLE_VIEW ROLE_CREATE ROLE_ADMIN{code}after logging in as {{user}} with only {{ROLE_VIEW}} privilege Jobs admin page is broken and is not displaying data. 403 error code is returned for following URLs:{code}http://localhost:9393/jobs/configurations.json?page=0&size=10http://localhost:9393/jobs/definitions.json?page=0&size=10{code}Looks like {{/jobs/configurations.\\\\*}} and {{/jobs/definitions.\\\\*}} URLs are not covered in security section of applications.yml file.\", \"fixVersions\": 2.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 1.0}'),('Spring_XD',1741,'XD-3220','87','{\"key\": \"XD-3220\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 87, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Karol Dowbecki\", \"summary\": \"Enabling security breaks job launching from Admin UI\", \"assignee\": \"Gunnar Hillert\", \"priority\": 1.0, \"reporter\": \"Karol Dowbecki\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"After enabling security (see XD-3214) and granting user {{ROLE_VIEW ROLE_CREATE ROLE_ADMIN}} privileges it\'s not possible to launch jobs from Admin UI. For {{bdl-sqoop-combo-lukasz-MONGO-DEV}} job 403 error is returned when Admin UI attempts to access following URL after \\\"Launch Job\\\" button is pressed:{code}http://ilabphd12.isus.emc.com:9393/jobs/executions?jobParameters=%7B%7D&jobname=bdl-sqoop-combo-lukasz-MONGO-DEV{code}Please see attached screenshot.\", \"fixVersions\": 2.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 1.0}'),('Spring_XD',1742,'XD-3219','87','{\"key\": \"XD-3219\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 87, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Ilayaperumal Gopinathan\", \"summary\": \"Fix random configuration in SecuredShellTests\", \"assignee\": \"Ilayaperumal Gopinathan\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Ilayaperumal Gopinathan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"Since the SecuredShellTests initialize singlenode app in a static way the random configuration needs to be setup statically as well.\", \"fixVersions\": 0.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1743,'XD-3118','88','{\"key\": \"XD-3118\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 88, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Update RPM script to include number of containers to be started\", \"assignee\": \"Thomas Risberg\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a user I\'d like to start multiple instances of {{xd-container}}\'s through the RPM scripts so I can easily spin-up instances on the same node/vm.\", \"fixVersions\": 2.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1744,'XD-3233','88','{\"key\": \"XD-3233\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 88, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Enable component model for spring-cloud-streams\", \"assignee\": \"Marius Bogoevici\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"As a developer I\'d like to create an annotation ({{@EnableModule}}) driven programming model for modules so instead of explicitly defining I/O channels as beans on the module for classes annotated with {{@EnableModule}} the application would be responsible for creating the actual channel beans and channel adapters vs. the developer creating concrete channel instance types.The {{@Input}} and {{@Output}} annotations will be used to indicate the input and output channels of the module. \", \"fixVersions\": 0.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1745,'XD-3224','88','{\"key\": \"XD-3224\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 88, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Move message-bus implemenation from XD to spring-cloud-streams [Phase #1]\", \"assignee\": \"David Turanski\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 1.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a developer I\'d like to move message-bus from Spring XD repo into spring-bus so I can update Spring XD to inherit the features/functionalities via maven dependency. \", \"fixVersions\": 0.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1746,'XD-3244','88','{\"key\": \"XD-3244\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 88, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"David Turanski\", \"summary\": \"Copy spring-xd-messagebus-* to SCS as spring-cloud-binding-*\", \"assignee\": \"David Turanski\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"David Turanski\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\":