mpleted in the last sprint. \", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 3.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1777,'XD-3310','90','{\"key\": \"XD-3310\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 90, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Add REST support for spring-cloud-data\", \"assignee\": \"Mark Fisher\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a s-c-d developer I\'d like to establish the foundation to expose REST-APIs to interact with the {{xd-admin}} and likewise perform CRUD operations to maneuver streaming and batch pipelines. \", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1778,'XD-3311','90','{\"key\": \"XD-3311\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 90, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Create ModuleRegistry stubs\", \"assignee\": \"Mark Fisher\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a s-c-d developer I\'d like to create {[ModuleRegistry}} stubs so I can create mock streams by interacting with the registry APIs.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1779,'XD-3312','90','{\"key\": \"XD-3312\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 90, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Move spring-cloud-stream-modules to spring-cloud repo\", \"assignee\": \"Mark Fisher\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0