, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 1.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a XD developer I\'d like to refactor and replace {{codec}} code from XD with SI library so I don\'t have to maintain duplicate code.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 1.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1903,'XD-3394','98','{\"key\": \"XD-3394\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 98, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Gary Russell\", \"summary\": \"Known Hosts Configuration for SFTP Source\", \"assignee\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Gary Russell\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"Spring Integration 4.2 changed the default SFTP session factory to *not* accept keys from unknown hosts by default. This is more secure.You either have to provide a pre-populated {{known_hosts}} file or set {{allowUnknownKeys}} to true.If you do both the keys will be automatically added to the known hosts file.When updating XD to 4.2.0.RC1 I simply set the boolean to true to retain the previous behavior.Add properties to the SFTP source to allow configuration of these properties at the stream level.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1904,'XD-3412','98','{\"key\": \"XD-3412\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 98, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Port SFTP as s-c-s source module\", \"assignee\": \"Gary Russell\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a Spring XD developer I\'d like to port SFTP module from XD to s-c-s repo