y Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a developer I\'d like to revisit the existing design and identify known limitations and/or the gaps. \", \"fixVersions\": 0.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1946,'XD-3705','101','{\"key\": \"XD-3705\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 101, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Bump Boot and spring-cloud-build Versions\", \"assignee\": \"Gary Russell\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 1.0, \"description\": \"As a developer I\'d like to upgrade Boot and Spring Cloud Build revisions so I can leverage the latest updates.\", \"fixVersions\": 0.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1947,'XD-3621','101','{\"key\": \"XD-3621\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 101, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Marius Bogoevici\", \"summary\": \"Add support for custom headers with the Kafka bus\", \"assignee\": \"Marius Bogoevici\", \"priority\": 3.0, \"reporter\": \"Marius Bogoevici\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"Currently the Kafka Message Bus does not have the ability to configure a set of custom headers to persist in the `embeddedHeaders` mode (only the message-bus specific) message headers are persisted. \", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 0.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 1.0}'),('Spring_XD',1948,'XD-3683','101','{\"key\": \"XD-3683\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 101, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Fix composed job error message\", \"assignee\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"As a user I\'m trying to compose a job just with one definition; however I\'m getting the following error message which could be misinterpreted.{code}xd:>job create salsa --definition timestampfileSuccessfully created job \'salsa\'xd:>job create foo --definition \\\"salsa || salsa\\\"Successfully created job \'foo\'xd:>job create foo222 --definition \\\"salsa\\\"Command failed org.springframework.xd.rest.client.impl.SpringXDException: Could not find module with name \'salsa\' and type \'job\'{code}\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 1.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1949,'XD-3684','101','{\"key\": \"XD-3684\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 101, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"summary\": \"Job composition fails for large transitions\", \"assignee\": \"Michael Minella\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Sabby Anandan\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 3.0, \"description\": \"As a user I\'m trying to create a composed job with >20 steps/transitions using Rabbit as the message bus and it doesn\'t complete successfully.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 6.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 0.0}'),('Spring_XD',1950,'XD-3685','101','{\"key\": \"XD-3685\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 101, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"summary\": \"Job Definitions page fails to display definitions if page \", \"assignee\": \"Gunnar Hillert\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Glenn Renfro\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blocked