": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 1.0, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 2.0, \"description\": \"I am using XD 1.2.1.RELEASE. I have following environment variables XD_CONFIG_NAME = mycompanyAnd SPRING_PROFILE_ACTIVE= prod admini have XD configuration file (mycompany-prod.yml) with following security configuration# Config to enable security on administration endpoints (consider adding ssl)spring:  profiles: prodsecurity:  basic:    enabled: true # false to disable security settings (default)    realm: SpringXDxd:  security:    authentication:      file:        enabled: true         users:          xdadmin: pwd ROLE_ADMINROLE_VIEWROLE_CREATEI get a login screen login works alright. When i logout - i still see all the tabs and contents in all the tabs. See the attached screenshot.\", \"fixVersions\": 1.0, \"commentCount\": 2.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 1.0}'),('Spring_XD',1979,'XD-3719','107','{\"key\": \"XD-3719\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 107, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"fadzi ushewokunze\", \"summary\": \"Spring flo issue with unexpected char\", \"assignee\": null, \"priority\": 3.0, \"reporter\": \"fadzi ushewokunze\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLinks\": 0.0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 3.0, \"description\": \"In Flo when creating a stream if you use asterisk you get an error. See the image attached.\", \"fixVersions\": 0.0, \"commentCount\": 3.0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0.0, \"affectedVersions\": 1.0}'),('Spring_XD',1980,'XD-3736','107','{\"key\": \"XD-3736\", \"votes\": 0.0, \"blocks\": 0.0, \"sprint\": 107, \"status\": \"Done\", \"creator\": \"Gary Russell\", \"summary\": \"Rabbit Pub/Sub Consumers Should Support Concurrency\", \"assignee\": \"Gary Russell\", \"priority\": 4.0, \"reporter\": \"Gary Russell\", \"subtasks\": 0.0, \"blockedBy\": 0.0, \"issueType\": \"Improvement\", \"dependedOn\": 0.0, \"issueLin