t com.intellij.rt.execution.junit.JUnitStarter.prepareStreamsAndStart(JUnitStarter.java:211)at com.intellij.rt.execution.junit.JUnitStarter.main(JUnitStarter.java:67)at sun.reflect.NativeMethodAccessorImpl.invoke0(Native Method)at sun.reflect.NativeMethodAccessorImpl.invoke(NativeMethodAccessorImpl.java:57)at com.intellij.rt.execution.application.AppMain.main(AppMain.java:134)Might be fixed by one of the other pull requests but we would need to verify.\", \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 3, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',74,'USERGRID-326','70','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-326\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"George Reyes\", \"summary\": \"Fix PartialUpdateTest by integrating it with new REST test framework.\", \"assignee\": \"ryan bridges\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"George Reyes\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 3, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 3, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',75,'USERGRID-331','70','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-331\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"George Reyes\", \"summary\": \"Fix AdminEmailEncodingIT by integrating it with new REST test framework\", \"assignee\": \"ryan bridges\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"George Reyes\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 3, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 4, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',76,'USERGRID-327','70','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-327\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"George Reyes\", \"summary\": \"Fix DuplicateNameIT test by integrating it with new REST test framework\", \"assignee\": \"ryan bridges\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"George Reyes\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 2, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 2, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',77,'USERGRID-273','70','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-273\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 4, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"Todd Nine\", \"summary\": \"5 Cleanup test harness and create a more declarative test framework\", \"assignee\": \"David Johnson\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"Todd Nine\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 4, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 5, \"storyPoint\": 8.0, \"watchcount\": 2, \"description\": \"Currently our test harnesses are a mess of spaghetti.  We need to decouple this mess and allow us to cleanly define the rules and requirements of our system.  I think we need to break it down into the following behaviors.h1. Test Execution Environmentsh2. Parallel ExecutionThis should be the default behavior.  All tests are assumed to be parallelh2. Serial ExecutionThis should be the exception and only used when parallel execution cannot be accomplished.  Tests in this classification should run in a method at a time with no concurrencyh1. External resourcesh2. Cassandra# Configure the runtime# Pre invocation hook## Create default implementation of truncating column families.  This should be manually added and not execute by default.# Post invocation hookh2. ElasticSearch # Configure the runtime# Pre invocation hook## Create default implementation of truncating column families.  This should be manually added and not execute by default.# Post invocation hookh1. LifecycleA test itself can have numerous lifecycle operations.  These should be set up as rules both class and instance and should NOT be done via inheritance of abstract tests.  This is the old Junit3 way of operating and needs removed.\", \"fixVersions\": 2, \"commentCount\": 5, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',78,'USERGRID-366','70','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-366\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"Todd Nine\", \"summary\": \"Eliminate 2 network calls for non optimistic transaction writes\", \"assignee\": \"Shawn Feldman\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"Todd Nine\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 1, \"description\": \"Currently when a write occurs that is either a new entity or a non optimistic transaction (I.E no version included in the payload) we\'re performing 2 writes in the collection module.  Instead we should perform a single write to both the transaction log and entity storage to reduce our network I/O.\", \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',79,'USERGRID-320','70','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-320\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"ryan bridges\", \"summary\": \"Add more meaningful query logic tests\", \"assignee\": \"ryan bridges\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"ryan bridges\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 2, \"description\": \"The REST tests for logical operations in queries is sorely lacking.  We need more tests for union intersection and negation as well as proper query grammar\", \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 4, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',80,'USERGRID-360','70','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-360\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 1, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"Rod Simpson\", \"summary\": \"Fix ImportIT REST tests\", \"assignee\": \"George Reyes\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"Rod Simpson\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 1, \"issueTy