312\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"Rod Simpson\", \"summary\": \"Implement App Delete in Usergrid 2 codebase \", \"assignee\": \"David Johnson\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"Rod Simpson\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 3, \"description\": \"We need a way to delete an application from an organization.Should only work with an org-admin level auth token.When delete is executed we will- Add application to the deleted apps collection.- Delete the application entity from the management app collection.- Sometime later we will delete the application\'s collectionsLet\'s do this for 2.0 and 1.0.  It should be possible with EntityManager level APIs only.\", \"fixVersions\": 2, \"commentCount\": 4, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',88,'USERGRID-363','70','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-363\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 1, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"David Johnson\", \"summary\": \"Provide REST test for Import Service\", \"assignee\": \"George Reyes\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"David Johnson\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 1, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 1, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 2, \"description\": \"Provide REST test coverage for the parts of our Import Service implemented in the REST module.\", \"fixVersions\": 2, \"commentCount\": 1, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 1}'),('UserGrid',89,'USERGRID-278','70','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-278\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"Shawn Feldman\", \"summary\": \"Implement Organization methods in Management Class for REST tests\", \"assignee\": \"George Reyes\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"Shawn Feldman\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 3, \"description\": \"Implement Organization methods in Management Class for REST tests\", \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 3, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',90,'USERGRID-359','70','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-359\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Open\", \"creator\": \"Todd Nine\", \"summary\": \"[SPIKE] Perform profiling of the Entity Manager and Relation Manager\", \"assignee\": null, \"priority\": 4, \"reporter\": \"Todd Nine\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 1, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 0, \"commentCount\": 1, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',91,'USERGRID-8','70','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-8\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"Rod Simpson\", \"summary\": \"Work out Usergrid 2.0 Roadmap\", \"assignee\": null, \"priority\": 4, \"reporter\": \"Rod Simpson\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Improvement\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 8, \"description\": \"This should be an epic but no epic option is available.The following is a loose roadmap of what is in store for \\\"2.0\\\" of Usergrid.  We welcome comments / questions.I. Overview- Refactoring and rebuilding the low-level persistence APIsII. Features / Goals- Optimistic Concurrency (No More Locking Nightmares)- Rock Solid Data Consistency- Establish (Cassandra Optimized) Persistence Usage Patterns- Ability to Support All Clients on Single Multi-tenant Mega Cluster- Cassandra Friendly Graph API- Asynchronous Staged Post-processing Pipeline- Optimizing Query Processing Engine- Circuit Breakers - Throttling & Load Management- Leverage Existing Netflix Infrastructure for Scalability (Elasticity)III. Phasesi. Exploration- discussion - small scale tests- code analysis with toolsii. Develop new architectureBelow is a link to an image of our proposed architecture plan. http://cl.ly/image/2j130R300f45iii.Build and Integrate1. Collection ManagerBuild:Collection Manager (Entity) persistenceGraph edgesGraph indexingIntegrate:Collection ServicesGraph Services (Services formerly known as Connections)Create migration for Graph and CollectionDeploy: Performance testingIntegration testing** Map Persistence and Time Series Persistence may not be needed2. Map PersistenceBuild:Map PersistenceIntegrate:Add shiro support for map persistenceCreate migration for security map persistenceDeployPerformance testingIntegration testing3. Time Series PersistenceBuild:Time Series PersistenceIntegrate:Queue servicesQueue query services DeployPerformance testingIntegration testing\", \"fixVersions\": 0, \"commentCount\": 8, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',92,'USERGRID-361','70','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-361\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 70, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"Rod Simpson\", \"summary\": \"Create REST test for app delete\", \"assignee\": \"David Johnson\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"Rod Simpson\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 2, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 1, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',93,'USERGRID-335','71','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-335\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 71, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"George Reyes\", \"summary\": \"Test Not Passing: CollectionsResourceIT\", \"assignee\": \"George Reyes\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"George Reyes\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 2, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 2, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',94,'USERGR