 tests are assumed to be parallelh2. Serial ExecutionThis should be the exception and only used when parallel execution cannot be accomplished.  Tests in this classification should run in a method at a time with no concurrencyh1. External resourcesh2. Cassandra# Configure the runtime# Pre invocation hook## Create default implementation of truncating column families.  This should be manually added and not execute by default.# Post invocation hookh2. ElasticSearch # Configure the runtime# Pre invocation hook## Create default implementation of truncating column families.  This should be manually added and not execute by default.# Post invocation hookh1. LifecycleA test itself can have numerous lifecycle operations.  These should be set up as rules both class and instance and should NOT be done via inheritance of abstract tests.  This is the old Junit3 way of operating and needs removed.\", \"fixVersions\": 2, \"commentCount\": 5, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',106,'USERGRID-333','71','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-333\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 71, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"George Reyes\", \"summary\": \"Fix ApplicationResourceIT\", \"assignee\": \"David Johnson\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"George Reyes\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 2, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 3, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',107,'USERGRID-320','71','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-320\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 71, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"ryan bridges\", \"summary\": \"Add more meaningful query logic tests\", \"assignee\": \"ryan bridges\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"ryan bridges\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 2, \"description\": \"The REST t