dBy\": 2, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 5, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 3, \"description\": \"When creating a new app no error is returned.  However the app never appears in the portal.  Investigate and fix this issue.\", \"fixVersions\": 0, \"commentCount\": 10, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',277,'USERGRID-530','107','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-530\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 107, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"David Johnson\", \"summary\": \"Deleting a connection to an Asset should not delete the Asset\'s data\", \"assignee\": \"David Johnson\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"David Johnson\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 1, \"storyPoint\": 1.0, \"watchcount\": 3, \"description\": \"Steps to reproduce:1) Create asset entity2) Create entity3) Create connection from entity to asset entity4) Delete connection5) Asset JSON still present Asset data is now gone\", \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 6, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 1}'),('UserGrid',278,'USERGRID-540','107','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-540\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 107, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"Shawn Feldman\", \"summary\": \"Test Not Passing: EntityManagerFactoryImplIT.testDeleteApplication \", \"assignee\": \"David Johnson\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"Shawn Feldman\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": null, \"watchcount\": 1, \"description\": \"java.lang.RuntimeException: System App b6768a08-b5d5-11e3-a495-10ddb1de66c3 should never be nullat org.apache.usergrid.corepersistence.CpEntityManagerFactory.getApplications(CpEntityManagerFactory.java:432)at org.apache.usergrid.corepersistence.CpEntityManagerFactory.getDeletedApplications(CpEntityManagerFactory.java:418)at org.apache.usergrid.persistence.cassandra.EntityManagerFactoryImplIT