hosen.  For example a single index strategy might have a single entity type but for the index per org/app it might have a separate entity type.  Looking up the management index would have a strategy where the index name matches the cassandra keyspace name\", \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',475,'USERGRID-698','138','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-698\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 138, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"Shawn Feldman\", \"summary\": \"Test Not Passing: ConnectionResourceTest.connectionsLoopbackTest:103 NullPointer\", \"assignee\": \"Todd Nine\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"Shawn Feldman\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Bug\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": 2.0, \"watchcount\": 1, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 0, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 0}'),('UserGrid',476,'USERGRID-746','138','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-746\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 0, \"sprint\": 138, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"David Johnson\", \"summary\": \"Improve performance of ExportAdmins via multi-threading\", \"assignee\": \"David Johnson\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"David Johnson\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 0, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 0, \"storyPoint\": 3.0, \"watchcount\": 1, \"description\": null, \"fixVersions\": 1, \"commentCount\": 2, \"dependedOnBy\": 0, \"affectedVersions\": 2}'),('UserGrid',477,'USERGRID-688','138','{\"key\": \"USERGRID-688\", \"votes\": 0, \"blocks\": 1, \"sprint\": 138, \"status\": \"Closed\", \"creator\": \"Shawn Feldman\", \"summary\": \"Fix Graph Compact Operations.  \", \"assignee\": \"Todd Nine\", \"priority\": 3, \"reporter\": \"Shawn Feldman\", \"subtasks\": 0, \"blockedBy\": 1, \"issueType\": \"Story\", \"dependedOn\": 0, \"issueLinks\": 1, \"storyPoint\": 5.0, \"watchcount\": 1, \"description\": \"when mark node in graph is