BufferingClientHttpRequest.java:48)at org.springframework.http.client.AbstractClientHttpRequest.execute(AbstractClientHttpRequest.java:52){noformat}',2,'Eric Bottard','Issues'),('Spring_XD','XD-1939','Update to Spring Batch Admin 1.3.0.RC1',NULL,1,'Mark Pollack','Issues'),('Spring_XD','XD-194',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Issues Summary'),('Spring_XD','XD-1940','Clean up duplicated dependencies from XD on YARN installation','Remove unnecessary/duplicated jars from the lib directory in spring-xd-yarn zip distribution',3,'Thomas Risberg','Issues'),('Spring_XD','XD-1941','No main manifest attribute in xd-yarn-client jar','Error deploying to YARN - $ ./spring-xd-1.0.0.BUILD-SNAPSHOT-yarn/bin/xd-yarn push -p spring-xd-1.0.0.BUILD-SNAPSHOT-yarnno main manifest attribute in spring-xd-1.0.0.BUILD-SNAPSHOT-yarn/lib/spring-xd-yarn-client-1.0.0.BUILD-SNAPSHOT.jarprobably related to boot changes',3,'Thomas Risberg','Issues'),('Spring_XD','XD-1942','Use guava 15.0 for spring-xd-integration-test','jclouds is not compatible with versions of guava higher than 15.',3,'Mark Pollack','Issues'),('Spring_XD','XD-1943','Update to Spring Batch Admin 1.3.0.GA',NULL,1,'Mark Pollack','Issues'),('Spring_XD','XD-1944','Error deploying stream when admin running and container arrives after stream deployment request','Steps to reproduce:1. start xd-admin2. start shell and create and deploy stream (\"time | hdfs\")3. start containerI got:[2014-07-10 09:10:29.019] boot - 19923ΓÇéΓÇéINFO [DeploymentSupervisorCacheListener-0] --- InitialDeploymentListener: Path cache event: /deployments/streams/test type: CHILD_ADDED[2014-07-10 09:10:29.137] boot - 19923ΓÇéΓÇéINFO [Deployer] --- StreamDeploymentListener: Deploying stream Stream{name=\'test\'}[2014-07-10 09:10:29.146] boot - 19923ΓÇéΓÇéWARN [Deployer] --- StreamDeploymentListener: No containers available for deployment of stream test[2014-07-10 09:10:29.146] boot - 19923ΓÇéΓÇéINFO [Deployer] --- StreamDeploymentListener: Stream Stream{name=\'test\'} deploymen