til.net.JIoEndpoint$SocketProcessor.run(JIoEndpoint.java:314)at java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor.runWorker(ThreadPoolExecutor.java:1145)at java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor$Worker.run(ThreadPoolExecutor.java:615)at org.apache.tomcat.util.threads.TaskThread$WrappingRunnable.run(TaskThread.java:61)at java.lang.Thread.run(Thread.java:745)',3,'David Johnson','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-581','Implement ability to createItemInCollection using the graph.','This should fix the broken test in the EntityManagerIt labeled: ownershipScopeCorrect',3,'George Reyes','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-582','Test Not Passing: CollectionIT Tests',NULL,3,'Shawn Feldman','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-583','Test Document Routing using External Test','Test routing of documents in ES using external test.',NULL,NULL,'Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-584','Test Not Passing: staleIndexCleanup','Seems like all of the stale entities aren\'t being cleaned up.',1,'George Reyes','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-585','Test migration from old index format to new','Test migration from old index format to new',3,'Michael Russo','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-586','Test app_info migration',NULL,3,'Shawn Feldman','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-587','Test Not Passing: IteratingQueryIT + collectionIT',NULL,1,'Todd Nine','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-588','Test and confirm Raw Push Notifications on Windows',NULL,3,'Shawn Feldman','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-589','Complete SNS/SQS async indexing api','Publish to SNSConsume from SQSComplete the SQS indexing impl with the new message endpointadd new interface for sqs vs in memory service',3,'Jeffrey West','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-592','[SPIKE] Investigate support for Central Usergrid SSO in the Portal','If Central Usergrid then the Portal should redirect the user to the central Usergrid instance for login/registration.And when the Portal gets an Admin User token from the Central Usergrid SSO system the Portal must validate it against the Usergrid system with which it is configured to work.This is a spike to design a possible solution for SSO support in portal.',3,'David Johnson','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-593','Implement Read by Graph Edges for no Query','When no query is specified we should read by graph edges and not read via elasticsearch.  The low level seek logic exists.  The relationManager simply needs to wire this functionality in.  A new Graph I/O interface should be created to cleanly implement and test this.',5,'Todd Nine','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-596','Confirm PUT by Name Does not Fetch/Query ES','We are seeing a large number of fetches/queries when we are doing PUT by name.  This creates load on ES and therefore makes indexing take longer.  We should make sure we\'re not hitting ES for PUT by name.',1,'Shawn Feldman','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-598','Merge two-dot-o-dev into two-dot-o',NULL,3,'David Johnson','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-601','Test Usergrid Central SSO',NULL,3,'David Johnson','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-602','Test Import / Export of Admin Users',NULL,2,'David Johnson','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-603',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Issues Summary'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-604','Spike: Core test suite should complete in Maven',NULL,1,NULL,'Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-606','Implement Async Indexing on New Edge',NULL,1,'Todd Nine','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-607','Implement Deleting Edge out of index','querying es for all edgesdeleting in bulkasync using async index service',1,'George Reyes','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-608','Refactor/Complete Delete Entity in 2.1','can o wormsrefactor cp relation manager into async serviceasync == async event service starts processlook at indexingservice',2,'George Reyes','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-609','Document the new IO framework',NULL,2,'George Reyes','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-610','Core Tests...','write more stories',NULL,'ryan bridges','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-612','Test Not Passing:  EntityConnectionsIT',NULL,3,'Todd Nine','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-613','Reindex endpoint should not be case-sensitive','the reindex endpoint: http://localhost:8080/system/index/rebuild/a34ad389-b626-11e4-848f-06b49118d7d0/Storelatlonsdoes not work due to case sensitivity.',1,'George Reyes','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-614','Refactor compaction operations to be declarative in 2.1','Currently our event system originates from too may points.  Both GraphManager and CollectionManager fire events for compaction.  This is causing issues with our event orchestration when we aggregate events in the core tier. A quick refactor needs to occur.  The following will need to happen.1) Define new compaction interfaces on the EntityCollectionManager and GraphManager2) Refactor the existing code to be invoked on these events3) Invoke the compaction at a higher level.  Mark will sill occur compaction will be deferred to the runtime. This allows a separate distributed subsystem to be created.',3,'Todd Nine','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-615','Inaccurate (or lack of) error message when logging into BaaS','In some cases the following error is uncaught and the portal fails to load:Uncaught TypeError: Cannot read property \'applications\' of undefinedUsergrid.Client.parseApplicationsArray @ usergrid-libs.min.js:14(anonymous function) @ usergrid-libs.min.js:14Usergrid.Client.request.xhr.onload @ usergrid-libs.min.js:13',NULL,'ryan bridges','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-616','Queries using greater/less than on float fields fail',NULL,3,NULL,'Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-617','Queries using order by on float fields result in incorrect ordering',NULL,3,NULL,'Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-618','Additional testing of Usergrid SSO',NULL,3,'David Johnson','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-621','Test Not Passing: InMemoryAsyncIndexServiceTest',NULL,2,'Shawn Feldman','Issues'),('UserGrid','USERGRID-622','Test Not Passing: IndexServiceTest',NULL,2,'Shawn Feldman','Issues'),('UserGrid'